cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this work, please cite the preprint below."
title: "Ocean: Scalar-Tensor Hydrodynamics"
abstract: >-
  Build system and source for a theoretical proposal in which the vacuum is a
  single continuous medium and gravity is proposed to be its response to
  concentrated energy, with Einstein's equation retained as the effective
  description and a localization criterion derived from the medium's own
  excitation spectrum.
type: software
